CHAPTER.VERS:
Casting down imaginations, and every high thing that exalteth itself against the knowledge of God, 

          An amplification of this spiritual power, which conquers the enemies in such a way, be they ever so crafty and mighty, that it brings some of them by repentance to Christ, and justly avenges others that are stubbornly obstinate, separating them from the others who allow themselves to be ruled.
         and bringing into captivity every thought to the obedience of Christ;
